## 4.5. Remove Kyverno Policy (If Applied)

_**If K8s team deployed the policy in Step 3.5**, remove it now to restore normal ArgoCD operations._

```bash
# K8s team only: Remove cluster-scoped policy from workload cluster
kubectl delete clusterpolicy argocd-migration-safeguard --context {{WORKLOAD_CLUSTER}}

# Verify policy is removed
kubectl get clusterpolicy argocd-migration-safeguard --context {{WORKLOAD_CLUSTER}} 2>&1 | grep "NotFound"
```

_Note: After policy removal, ArgoCD will automatically reconcile any cleanup/pruning operations that were delayed during the cleanup window. **If policy was not deployed, skip this step.**_

